    {
      "source": "<span class=\"deprecated-label\">Deprecated, for removal: This API element is subject to removal in a future version.</span>",
      "translation": "<code class=\"deprecated-label\">已弃用，即将移除：此 API 元素将在未来版本中被移除。</code>",
      "count": 10
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the <a href=\"ParameterTypes.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.util\"><code>ParameterTypes</code></a> for the given list of <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/TypeDescriptor.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert\"><code>TypeDescriptor</code></a>s.",
      "translation": "返回给定 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/TypeDescriptor.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert\"><code>TypeDescriptor</code></a> 列表的 <a href=\"ParameterTypes.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.util\"><code>ParameterTypes</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns whether the current parameter types match the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Method.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\"><code>Method</code></a>'s parameters exactly, i.e. they're\nequal, not only assignable.",
      "translation": "返回当前参数类型是否与给定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Method.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\"><code>Method</code></a> 的参数完全匹配，即它们必须相等，而不仅仅是可赋值。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>method</code> - must not be null.",
      "translation": "<code>method</code> 不能为 null。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<small>Copyright © 2011–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>. All rights reserved.</small>",
      "translation": "<small>版权所有 © 2011–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>。保留所有权利。</small>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Abstraction over a list of parameter value types. Allows to check whether a list of parameter values with the given\ntype setup is a candidate for the invocation of a given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Method.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\"><code>Method</code></a> (see <a href=\"#areValidFor(java.lang.reflect.Method)\"><code>areValidFor(Method)</code></a>). This is\nnecessary to properly match parameter values against methods declaring varargs arguments. The implementation favors\ndirect matches and only computes the alternative sets of types to be considered if the primary one doesn't match.",
      "translation": "对参数值类型列表的抽象。它允许检查具有给定类型设置的参数值列表是否为调用某个 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Method.html\" title=\"java.lang.reflect 中的类或接口\"><code>Method</code></a> 的候选项（参见 <a href=\"#areValidFor(java.lang.reflect.Method)\"><code>areValidFor(Method)</code></a>）。这是为了正确地将参数值与声明了可变参数参数的方法进行匹配所必需的。实现优先采用直接匹配，仅当主要匹配方案不匹配时，才会计算需要考量的替代类型集合。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns whether the parameter types are valid for the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Method.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\"><code>Method</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回给定<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Method.html\" title=\"java.lang.reflect 中的类或接口\"><code>Method</code></a>的参数类型是否有效。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns whether the parameter types are valid for the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Method.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\"><code>Method</code></a>. That means, a parameter value list with\nthe given type arrangement is a valid list to invoke the given method.",
      "translation": "返回给定 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Method.html\" title=\"java.lang.reflect 中的类或接口\"><code>Method</code></a> 的参数类型是否有效。这意味着，具有给定类型排列的参数值列表是调用该方法的合法列表。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "since 4.0, this class is not intended for public use and will be removed in future versions.",
      "translation": "自 4.0 版本起，该类不再供公开使用，将在未来版本中移除。",
      "count": 1
    },
